# Implementation Plan - Phase 1 Extension: Closing the Gaps

# Goal Description
Complete the pending "Core Marketplace" execution tasks. This focuses on the Consumer-facing application (Browsing, Cart, Checkout UI) and the robust Order Management System (State Machine) required for the system to actually function end-to-end.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Order State Machine**:
> We need to strictly enforce the state transitions: `CREATED` -> `AUTHORIZED` (Stripe Hold) -> `ACCEPTED` (Store confirms) -> `READY` -> `FULFILLED`.
> - **Auto-Cancel**: If not accepted in 30 mins (SLA).

> [!WARNING]
> **Inventory Locking**:
> When an order is created, we must decrement inventory. If payment fails, we must increment it back (Optimistic locking).

